1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
One day of motorcycle touring leaves
68 gigabytes of video.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Somewhere in it is a story worth watching.

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:20,000
Finding it by hand means scrubbing
through hours of road.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Ride Storyteller reads the GPS track
first - two and a half megabytes.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:36,500
It extracts events it can explain:
departure, climbs, turns, arrival.

6
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:45,000
GPS says where to look.
It never says what the camera saw.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:53,000
One thing cannot be decided from the data:
did the camera's clock agree with the GPS?

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
The system proposes the offset with its
evidence; a person confirms one number.

9
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Everything else is decided from evidence.

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Most of a ride is never filmed, and the
gaps are not filled with invented footage.

11
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Each uncovered stretch becomes a chapter
card carrying only what the track proves:

12
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:30,000
how long, how far, how much climb -
and the route with that stretch marked.

13
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Honest about its own coverage.

14
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:43,000
From there it is one page: copies made,
judgement bought, story planned,

15
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:51,500
cards drawn, film cut, subtitled, scored.
Buying starts only when the exact figure

16
00:01:51,500 --> 00:02:00,000
shown is typed back. A film is never cut
from a judgement no model was paid for.

17
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Gemini decides what the film shows. Each
window is copied down on the rider's machine

18
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:15,000
to a few hundred kilobytes: 95 megabytes for
a day, not 68 gigabytes. Only those are sent.

19
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:22,000
Gemini 2.5 Flash judges every one. This ride
cost 26 yen; the 4K source never left.

20
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,000
The hosted agent: Agent Builder ADK and
Agent Engine, synthetic events only.

21
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:33,000
IBM Bob reviewed the architecture and
found missing ADK wiring,

22
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:40,000
missing evidence transitions, and gaps in
the boundary tests. We implemented them.

23
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:47,000
This is one ride, start to finish: it
opens on the departure card,

24
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:52,000
crosses the stretches nobody filmed,
and closes on arrival.

25
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:55,000
No narration. Every second evidenced.

26
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Telemetry becomes questions. Video becomes
evidence. The source stays on your machine.
